{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23193","headline":"七言十二句赠驾部吴郎中七兄 · 白居易","name":"七言十二句赠驾部吴郎中七兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四月天气和且清，绿槐阴合沙堤平。\n独骑善马衔镫稳，初着单衣肢体轻。\n退朝下直少徒侣，归舍闭门无送迎。\n风生竹夜窗间卧，月照松时台上行。\n春酒冷尝三数醆，晓琴闲弄十余声。\n幽怀静境何人别，唯有南宫老驾兄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}